    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midtris is mind bending puzzle game where your goal is to place blocks around the center piece and clear layers of perfect squares. Blocks will appear from 4 different directions and game will get harder as you destroy more blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.poster.avif?t=1750150820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.webm?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.mp4?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 different game modes to play. Bombs and other special blocks will spice up the gameplay. Classic mode will offer more traditional block stacking experience without bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges and unlock new block styles. These should offer challenge even for experienced players, but if that is not enough you can compete with other players on global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.poster.avif?t=1750150820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.webm?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.mp4?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midtris is sequel for Centrist with modern rules. Some of the new features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRS (Wall kicks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More pieces shown in next block displayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated UI and menu backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game modes (Midtris &amp; Pentos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score rework</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midtris is mind bending puzzle game where your goal is to place blocks around the center piece and clear layers of perfect squares. Blocks will appear from 4 different directions and game will get harder as you destroy more blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.poster.avif?t=1750150820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.webm?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/eb239246284ae5abcf404f2013f4e48f.mp4?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 5 different game modes to play. Bombs and other special blocks will spice up the gameplay. Classic mode will offer more traditional block stacking experience without bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges and unlock new block styles. These should offer challenge even for experienced players, but if that is not enough you can compete with other players on global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.poster.avif?t=1750150820\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.webm?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591660/extras/23d9d21cffebf289e7d33171ff70166d.mp4?t=1750150820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midtris is sequel for Centrist with modern rules. Some of the new features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRS (Wall kicks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More pieces shown in next block displayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated UI and menu backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game modes (Midtris &amp; Pentos)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score rework</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
